WEBVTT

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:01.873
What song gets your whole table

00:00:01.891 --> 00:00:03.714
onto the dance floor in two notes?

00:00:04.451 --> 00:00:05.732
That's the idea behind

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.218
Retro Glam Sessions.

00:00:07.944 --> 00:00:09.118
Picture the evening.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.507
You arrive for a cocktail.

00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:14.216
Someone has dressed for the
seventies.

00:00:14.941 --> 00:00:16.235
Someone else skipped straight

00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:17.206
to the nineties.

00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:20.049
You squeeze into the photo set
together.

00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:22.598
Then the DJ changes records,

00:00:22.686 --> 00:00:24.326
you hear those first two notes,

00:00:24.378 --> 00:00:25.735
and the table empties.

00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:27.840
We're planning the first edition

00:00:27.858 --> 00:00:28.971
in South Florida.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.651
Join the Retro Glam priority list

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:33.085
for the date, the venue

00:00:33.103 --> 00:00:35.184
and ticket details when they're
announced.
